  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-elements.html#dom-meter-value\r\n\r\n> The value IDL attribute, on getting, must return the actual value\\. On setting, the given value must be converted to the best representation of the number as a floating\\-point number and then the value content attribute must be set to that string\\.\r\n\r\nIn the above, \"the value content attribute\" actually ends up linking to the value IDL attribute (#dom-meter-value), whereas it should like to the content attribute (#attr-meter-value).\r\n\r\nThe same problem occurs for the other paragraphs following this one. All of them should be changed.",
